{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1506960-have-you-ever-thought-about-it","id":1506960,"title":"Have you ever thought about it?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-30T10:25:54-07:00","id":1506960,"title":"Have you ever thought about it?","content":"Have you ever thought about creating your own game by playing a game? Have you dreamed of becoming a developer?<br /> <br /> I think a lot of gamers have had such thoughts.<br /> What game would you create?\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27694-devamona","name":"devamona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27694_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-30T14:37:11-07:00","id":1506990,"title":"","content":"I created a Hobbit board game once, but obviously I lack the rights to that so it was just an exercise to see if I could make something fun... it was pretty OK for the time, and I was still more into war-gaming than RPGs, but I felt I got the asymmetry down so each player - controlling a different character during the escape from the goblins of the Misty Mountains - had unique perks, disadvantages, and victory conditions in a fashion that emulated the story without making the ending a forgone conclusion.<br /> <br /> The closest I came to becoming a real game designer was when I was asked by a friend to develop a custom system for his setting that he wanted to publish as a full RPG. We got really far, but in the end I think he really didn't appreciate the amount of work he needed to do for me to move from basic mechanics into specific ones. I can't write a magic system if he can't decide what he wants magic use to be like in the setting (he wanted something in the area of magic being something everyone could do in theory if you knew the right procedures, and magic specialists were people that went beyond memorizing a few rote incantations and knew the syntax well enough to design spells, but it was a long developed process and was pretty stressful). Eventually he just decided to move to FATE instead. As we had agreed that the system would be credited as cowritten, it basically go stuck in limbo.. plus it's pretty dated now anyway even if I wanted to ask him about giving it over to me fully.<br /> <br /> Shortly before the pandemic I got inspired to do my own thing... it's a bit much to explain, but one of the things I really like about what I have so far is that doesn't really fit the idea of a bespoke game (aka WoD with its own setting and custom rules) or a generic game (that's meant to do anything in a specific rules style). I focuses on a core dramatic tension, and then world building is part of the game as the players decide where to put the tension and how it will be interacted with. It's not generic because the core conflict is the central focus (it's also a fairly light game right now, somewhere around a PbtA level of rules heft), but it's not bespoke either because the players can decide to make a slice of life game where these thing has always been there and they're just the latest people to deal with it, or make it like a Star Trek episode and this is the big story that arises from vising this particular planet. Unfortunately COVID's impact drove that to the back burned quite severely (I literally started my first draft in Sept. 19, and lockdown proved to be a detriment to my writing instead of giving me free time to work on it). I'm finally starting to feel like I can get back to it again, though I'm not sure how I'm going to feel about it now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-30T15:58:10-07:00","id":1507000,"title":"","content":"I am still wrestling with a magical girl RPG to my satisfaction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-31T01:35:52-07:00","id":1507034,"title":"","content":"Huh, I'm sure everyone has thought about it for some time. Especially since we were kids. I really wanted to make my own game when I started playing video games. I even took a game development course, but it turned out to be complicated and not as much fun as I imagined. So I changed my focus from game development to making easier websites and apps. I know javascript and react.js very well and am slowly moving on to <a href=\"https://qit.software/advantages-of-node-js-in-2023/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">https://qit.software/advantages-of-node-js-in-2023/</span></a>. But I'm not interested in game development. It's much more interesting to play a game than to create one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27589,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27589-seylen","user":"seylen","date":". 03-31-2023, 10:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27589-seylen","name":"seylen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-31T01:47:17-07:00","id":1507039,"title":"","content":"Once or twice. I'd probably create a game about b-movies and aquatic invaders, or something about a subterranean dystopia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-31T02:22:26-07:00","id":1507043,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1506960-have-you-ever-thought-about-it?p=1507039#post1507039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once or twice. I'd probably create a game about b-movies and aquatic invaders, or something about a subterranean dystopia.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh man, I never would have guessed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T09:46:08-07:00","id":1507110,"title":"","content":"I tried creating a Shadowrun/Star Wars type setting with a signature city a few years ago. Earth was still around but decades of war and enviromental disasters had reduced the population to a few hundred million. I'm still trying to fine detail the setting some more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T15:07:56-07:00","id":1507121,"title":"","content":"We used to create our own RPGs all the time; most of the time, we were talking about the mechanics and rarely about the setting; we never thought of being our own developers though. It seemed as a hobby rather than other ways to make money, like in computers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T13:40:50-07:00","id":1507205,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s was more of a passion project for me and I\u2019d never thought about being a professional.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-04T17:27:48-07:00","id":1510738,"title":"","content":"I'm an aspiring author and constant world builder. I'm always trying to crack the code on how to maintain energy to develop a game or write a full story while still working a tech support job.<br /> <br /> That said;<br /> - High Fantasy that has had it's version of an Information Age, highly cinematic setting<br /> - Cyberpunk with an emphasis on Transhumanism<br /> <br /> Those are my big 2 settings I wanted to do in the past. Right now I'm trying my hand at writing a Trinity setting to try putting up on Nexus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27972-gm-janus","name":"GM Janus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-06T21:16:49-07:00","id":1510955,"title":"","content":"I had a card game that ended up having some problems with pretty fundamental elements of its design in playtesting that I want to revisit at some point. As far as RPGs, I've been mulling around how to make a tabletop game to replicate the vibes of a kaiju movie supporting both play as scared humans like most Godzilla movies and mecha/toku hero vs. monster plots with more empowered protagonists, but haven't come to any solid answers yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27841-haintbleu","name":"HaintBleu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-29T17:15:05-07:00","id":1521630,"title":"","content":"On a lark I thought it would be fun to combine genres and characters such as Sherlock Holmes &amp; The Frankenstein monster as being the same guy, Jeckyll &amp; Hyde with Mr. Watson and the old Hollywood monsters into an absurd setting and I got a few chuckles and we did try it out and found it fun. I never thought of taking it further as it would take the enjoyment of the fun idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-01T06:00:10-07:00","id":1521809,"title":"","content":"Do I have ideas? Yes.<br /> Do I have a firm enough grasp on the concepts to develop them further? No<br /> Do I have the time and focus for it? Not right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-29T12:40:15-07:00","id":1537875,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking of adding more Cyberpunk elements in my Shadow Run/ Star Wars idea with my main city.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-29T20:09:37-07:00","id":1537887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1506960-have-you-ever-thought-about-it?p=1537875#post1537875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm thinking of adding more Cyberpunk elements in my Shadow Run/ Star Wars idea with my main city.</div> </div> </div> </div>What sort of elements?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-30T11:41:41-07:00","id":1537899,"title":"","content":"More techno style magic and psionics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://